    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 16:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna mhayo go ng'wa SEEBA gūng'wizīīla Yehu ng'witūnja o ng'wa Hanaani kūlwa nguno ya būhūbi bo ng'wa Baasha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.16.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.16.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 16:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwiza gūlīhaya, “Nakakūbūūcha nūkūgūngūmūla kūfuma mu lūbuubu, nūkwīta kūbiza nsugi wa banhū bane a Baisilaeli; alīyo hūna wandya kūshimīzīla mu nzīla ja ng'wa Yeloboamu, kūbenheleja a banhū bane a Baisilaeli kūhūba, na kongeja kūnipelanya kūlwa nguno ya būhūbi wabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.16.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.16.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 16:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na lūūlū nakūnkenaagūla ū Baasha nī kaya yakwe; ī kaya yako nakwīyīta ībize gītī ya ng'wa Yeloboamu ng'witūnja o ng'wa Nebati. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.16.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.16.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 16:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A banhū ba ng'wa Baasha abo bakūchīla mu nzengo bakūliiwa mvwa, a ba kūchīla kū matogolo bakūliiwa noni.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.16.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.16.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 16:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mihayo yīngī ī ya mu shikū ja būtemi bo ng'wa Baasha, nī yīyo wīta, nī ya būtindi wakwe; ī yose yandīkilwe mu shitabo sha ng'hūlū ja batemi ba Isilaeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.16.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.16.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 16:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Baasha wifuula na bakūlūgenji bakwe, ūjīīkwa mu nzengo gwa Tiliza. Ng'witūnja wakwe Ela wingīla a ha ng'wanya gwakwe, ūbiza ntemi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.16.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.16.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 16:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū mhayo go ng'wa SEEBA gwang'wizīīla ū ng'hangi Yehu ū ng'witūnja o ng'wa Hanaani kūlwa nguno ya kūūmanīkīja ū Baasha nī numba yakwe, nguno ū būhūbi ūbo walī wawīta ū mu miso ga ng'wa SEEBA walī būtaale no. Walī wampelanya no ū SEEBA kūlwa nguno ya shītīle shose īsho walī washīta, kūshisha nang'hwe ūbiza gīt'ūmo yalī dūhū ī numba ya ng'wa Yeloboamu; na kūlwa nguno ū wei akīkenaagūla pyī ī kaya ya ng'wa Yeloboamu!",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.16.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.16.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ela ntemi wa Isilaeli",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 16:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.16.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.16.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 16:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mu ng'waka gwa makūmi abīlī n'ītandatū go būtemi bo ng'wa Asa ū ntemi wa Yuda, Ela ng'witūnja o ng'wa Baasha ūbiza ntemi wa Isilaeli; ūtema ikanza lya myaka ībīlī alī mu nzengo gwa Tiliza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.16.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.16.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 16:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūmò wa bataale ba bashilikale bakwe ūng'wijomboka, lina lyakwe walī Zimuli, ntongeeji wa nusu y'ibità lya bashilikale ba magogoteni. Ī likanza lyenīlo ū Ela walī mu nzengo gwa Tiliza wang'waga walwa mu numba ya ng'wa Aza, ūyo walī ntaale wa kahelele ka milīmo ya ng'wikūlū lya Tiliza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.16.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.16.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 16:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Zimuli aho wiza moi ūshikīla kūntūla ūmūlaga; gwalī ng'waka gwa makūmi abīlī na mpungatī go būtemi bo ng'wa Asa ū ntemi wa Yuda. Hūna wingīla a ha ng'wanya gwakwe, ūbiza ntemi wei. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.16.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.16.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 16:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho wigasha a h'isumbī lya būtemi, ūbona gīkī watema, haho na haho ūbabūlaga pye a banhū ba numba ya ng'wa Baasha. Atalekeelile ngosha nūūlū ūmò; abize ndūgū nūūlū nwani wa kaya yenīyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.16.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.16.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 16:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na lūūlū ū Zimuli ūbiza wīmala pyī ī numba ya ng'wa Baasha; kūlenganīla nū mhayo go ng'wa SEEBA ūyo gwalī gwahayiwa na ng'hangi Yehu kūlwa nguno ya ng'wa Baasha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.16.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.16.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 16:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguno ū Baasha walī wīta būhūbi būtaale no; pyī nū ng'witūnja wakwe ū Ela, ūbenheleja a Baisilaeli kūhūba, būbiza bampelanya ū SEEBA ū Mulungu wa Isilaeli, kūlwa shiikolile īsho shitī na ngofyoolo nūūlū hado. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.16.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.16.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 16:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mihayo yīngī ī ya mu shikū ja būtemi bo ng'wa Ela, nī yose īyo wīta yandīkilwe mu shitabo sha ng'hūlū ja batemi ba Isilaeli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.16.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.16.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Zimuli ntemi wa Isilaeli",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 16:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.16.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.16.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 16:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mu ng'waka gwa makūmi abīlī na mpungatī go būtemi bo ng'wa Asa ū ntemi wa Yuda, Zimuli ūbiza ntemi wa Isilaeli; ūtema ikanza lya shikū mpungatī alī mu Tiliza. Ī likanza lyenīlo ī libità lya bashilikale lyalī kū būlūgū kū nzengo gwa Gibesoni mu sī ya Bafilisiti. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.16.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.16.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 16:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A Baisilaeli aho bigwa gīkī ū Zimuli wang'wijombokaga ū ntemi ūmūlaga, haho na haho būnsola Omuli, ūyo walī ntaale wa mabità ga bashilikale; būng'wīta kūbiza ntemi wa Isilaeli ū lūshikū lwenūlo ū kū ng'hambī ya būlūgū kwenūko. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.16.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.16.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 16:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū Omuli na a Baisilaeli a bose bīnga ī Gibesoni, biza kūgūgobanīla ū nzengo gwa Tiliza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.16.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.16.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 16:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Zimuli aho wabona gwading'wa ū nzengo, ūpeelela mu numba y'ikūlū ūkingīla ng'wipandī īlo lyatūmamaga kūlwa kwibisa na kūpīlīla; hūna witwimīīla moto, ūchīla ng'wenūmo, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.16.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.16.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 16:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kūlwa nguno ya būhūbi wakwe ūbo walī wawīta; ūbeeja yabūbi ū mu miso ga ng'wa SEEBA, kūlwa kūshimīzīla mu nzīla ja ng'wa Yeloboamu, nū būkenaagūji ūbo akīīta, kūshisha ūbenheleja a Baisilaeli kūhūba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.16.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.16.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 16:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mihayo yīngī ī ya mu shikū ja būtemi bo ng'wa Zimuli, nū būgomi wakwe ūbo akawīta, ī yose yandīkilwe mu shitabo sha ng'hūlū ja batemi ba Isilaeli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.16.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.16.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Omuli ntemi wa Isilaeli",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 16:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.16.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.16.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 16:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī likanza lyenīlo a Baisilaeli būgabanhīka magelè abīlī, igelè līmò lyalī lītogilwe ū ntemi abize Tibuni ng'witūnja o ng'wa Ginasi, ī ligelè ī līngī lyalī līntogilwe ū Omuli gīkī ū ng'wene h'abize ntemi wabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.16.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.16.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 16:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ī ligelè lya ng'wa Omuli lyūkwīja ī nguzu kūtinda ī lya ng'wa Tibuni ū ng'witūnja o ng'wa Ginasi. Na lūūlū ū Tibuni ūbūlagwa, ū Omuli h'ūyo ūbiza ntemi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.16.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.16.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 16:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mu ng'waka gwa makūmi adatū na gūmò go būtemi bo ng'wa Asa ū ntemi wa Yuda, Omuli ūbiza ntemi wa Isilaeli; ūtema ikanza lya myaka ikūmi n'ībīlī; myaka ītandatū ū mu yenīyo walī mu Tiliza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.16.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.16.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 16:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūgūla lūgūlū lwa Samalia kūfuma kūlī Shema; ūfunya feza ja būdito wa kilo makūmi mpungatī, hūna ūtūūla nzengo a ha lūgūlū lwenūlo, ūgwitana lina lya Samalia kūlwa kūliizūkwa ī lina lya ng'wa Shema, ūyo walī ng'wenekīlī lūgūlū. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.16.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.16.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 16:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwike nang'hwe ū Omuli wīta yabūbi ū mu miso ga ng'wa SEEBA, ūkenaagūla no, kūtinda a batongi bakwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.16.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.16.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 16:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguno ūshimīzīla ū mu nzīla ī jose ī ja ng'wa Yeloboamu ū ng'witūnja o ng'wa Nebati, nū mu būhūbi wakwe ūbo walī wabenheleja a Baisilaeli kūhūba, kūshisha būmpelanya no ū SEEBA ū Mulungu wa Isilaeli kūlwa shiikolile shabo īsho shitī na ngofyoolo nūūlū hado. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.16.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.16.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 16:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mihayo yīngī ī ya mu shikū ja būtemi bo ng'wa Omuli, īyo wīta nī ya būtindi wakwe, ī yose yandīkilwe mu shitabo sha ng'hūlū ja batemi ba Isilaeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.16.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.16.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 16:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Omuli wifuula na bakūlūgenji bakwe, ūjīkwa mu nzengo gwa Samalia. Ng'witūnja wakwe Ahabu wingīla a ha ng'wanya gwakwe, ūbiza ntemi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.16.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.16.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ahabu kūbiza ntemi wa Isilaeli",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 16:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.16.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.16.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 16:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mu ng'waka gwa makūmi adatū n'īnaane go būtemi bo ng'wa Asa ū ntemi wa Yuda, Ahabu ng'witūnja o ng'wa Omuli ūbiza ntemi wa Isilaeli; ūtema ikanza lya myaka makūmi abīlī n'ībīlī alī mu nzengo gwa Samalia. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.16.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.16.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 16:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Ahabu ng'witūnja o ng'wa Omuli akīīta yabūbi no ū mu miso ga ng'wa SEEBA kūbaheeba a batongi bakwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.16.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.16.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 16:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguno atagelelile kūbona dūhū gīkī gūlī mhayo ndo no ū gwa kūshimīzīla mu būhūbi bo ng'wa Yeloboamu ng'witūnja o ng'wa Nebati, alīyo akantoola na Yezebeli nshīke o ng'wa Etibaali, ntemi wa Basidoni; wandya kūntūmamīla Baalī na kūnamya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.16.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.16.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 16:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūzenga hekalu ya ng'wa Baalī ū mu Samalia; ūtūūla mo na ng'walīlo go ng'wa Baalī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.16.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.16.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 16:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Ahabu ūbeeja na ng'hīngī ya ng'wa Ashela, ongeja kūmpelanya no no no ū SEEBA, ū Mulungu wa Isilaeli; ūnsaayīcha kūtinda ūmo balī bansaayīkīja a batemi ba Isilaeli a bangī a ba kū numa yakwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.16.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.16.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 16:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū mu shikū ja ng'wa Ahabu, munhū ūmò lina lyakwe Hieli muna Beeseli, ūgūzenga būpya ū nzengo gwa Yeliko. A h'ikanza lya kūgūsīmbīla ū nsingi gwago, ūchīlwa na ng'witūnja wakwe tangī, lina lyakwe Abilamu. Hama a h'ikanza lya kwītūūla ī mibita yaho, ūchīlwa na ng'witūnja wakwe kwangūlīja, lina lyakwe Segubu. Gūūshikīīla ū mhayo go ng'wa SEEBA ūyo gwalī gwahayiwa na Yoshwa ng'witūnja o ng'wa Nuni.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.16.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.16.34"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
